IF NODE G71F06R DEPTH < 0.36
AND NODE G72K020 DEPTH < 0.40
AND NODE G71F090 DEPTH < 0.791
AND NODE G71F68Y DEPTH > 1.03
AND PUMP G71F68Yp1 TIMECLOSED > 00:02
THEN PUMP G71F68Yp1 STATUS = ON

